  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The retention of the bike shed, by reason of its prominent\r\nsiting within the front garden of the property, would result in a visually\r\nintrusive and incongruous form of development that fails to respond positively\r\nto the character of the host dwelling and the established appearance of the\r\nsurrounding streetscene. The proposed painting of the structure and planting of\r\na hedge would not sufficiently mitigate the resulting visual harm. As such, the\r\nproposal is contrary to Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021) and\r\nStrategic Policy D12.1 and Policies D12.3 and D12.4 of the Merton Local Plan\r\n(2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
